PROJECT: EtherFi

## Ecosystem Position

Primary Sector: Liquid Restaking Protocol
Secondary Sector: Liquid Staking Token (LST) Provider, DeFi Infrastructure, Real-World Asset (RWA) Bridge via EtherFi Cash
Primary Chain: Ethereum
Supported Chains: Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast, Linea, Scroll, zkSync Era, Mantle, BNB Chain
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi/etherfi-v2-liquid-restaking/, https://defillama.com/protocol/etherfi

## External Dependencies

Dependency Name: EigenLayer
Dependency Type: Protocol
Purpose: Primary restaking layer — eETH dan weETH didelegasikan ke EigenLayer AVS melalui StrategyManager dan DelegationManager untuk restaking rewards
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: EigenLayer
Related Technology Component: EigenLayer Integration (StrategyManager / DelegationManager), eETH, weETH
Sources: https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking, https://github.com/Layr-Labs/eigenlayer-contracts

Dependency Name: Symbiotic
Dependency Type: Protocol
Purpose: Alternative restaking layer — eETH dan weETH didelegasikan ke Symbiotic Vault/Network untuk diversifikasi AVS
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Symbiotic
Related Technology Component: Symbiotic Integration (Vault / Network), eETH, weETH
Sources: https://docs.symbiotic.fi, https://docs.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi

Dependency Name: Pendle
Dependency Type: Protocol
Purpose: Yield trading market untuk eETH/weETH — Principal Tokens (PT) dan Yield Tokens (YT) memungkinkan fixed yield dan speculation
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Pendle
Related Technology Component: Pendle Integration (PT/YT market contracts), eETH, weETH
Sources: https://docs.pendle.finance, https://blog.ether.fi, https://app.pendle.finance

Dependency Name: Ethereum
Dependency Type: Chain
Purpose: Settlement layer utama — semua smart contract inti (eETH, weETH, ETHFI, StakeManager, Vaults, ULN, Governance) dideploy di Ethereum Mainnet
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Ethereum
Related Technology Component: All core contracts (StakeManager, eETH, weETH, ETHFI, Vaults, ULN, Governor, Timelock)
Sources: https://ethereum.org, https://etherscan.io/token/0x35fA164735182de50811E8e2E824cFb9B6118ac2, https://etherscan.io/token/0xCd5fE23C85820F7B72D0926FC9b05b43E359b7ee

Dependency Name: Arbitrum
Dependency Type: Chain
Purpose: L2 deployment untuk weETH — canonical bridge dan DeFi composability
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Arbitrum
Related Technology Component: weETH (Arbitrum deployment), Bridge Contracts (Arbitrum Bridge)
Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.io, https://arbiscan.io, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging

Dependency Name: Optimism
