## Major Integrations

Integration Name: EigenLayer Mainnet Integration
Integrated With: EigenLayer
Purpose: Delegasi eETH/weETH ke EigenLayer AVS melalui StrategyManager — restaking rewards otomatis, slashing risk sharing
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-007
Sources: https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking, https://blog.ether.fi

Integration Name: EigenLayer Specific AVS Integration (EigenDA, etc.)
Integrated With: EigenLayer
Purpose: Aktifkan delegasi ke AVS spesifik (EigenDA data availability, dll) — memperluas yield sources
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-021
Sources: https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz/avs, https://docs.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi

Integration Name: Symbiotic Integration
Integrated With: Symbiotic
Purpose: Restaking layer alternatif — deploy Symbiotic Vault/Network integration, delegasi eETH/weETH ke Symbiotic networks
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-013
Sources: https://docs.symbiotic.fi, https://docs.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi

Integration Name: Pendle Integration
Integrated With: Pendle
Purpose: Yield trading eETH/weETH via PT/YT markets — fixed yield dan speculation yield
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-014
Sources: https://docs.pendle.finance, https://blog.ether.fi, https://app.pendle.finance

Integration Name: Multi-Chain weETH Deployment (Batch 1)
Integrated With: Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast
Purpose: Deploy weETH contracts ke 5 L2 — canonical bridge + third-party bridge integration untuk DeFi composability
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-018 (partial)
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi, https://arbiscan.io, https://optimistic.etherscan.io, https://basescan.org, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging

Integration Name: Multi-Chain weETH Deployment (Batch 2)
Integrated With: Linea, Scroll, zkSync Era, Mantle, BNB Chain
Purpose: Deploy weETH contracts ke 5 chain tambahan — ekspansi total 10+ chain
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-018 (partial)
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi, https://lineascan.build, https://scrollscan.com, https://explorer.zksync.io, https://mantlescan.xyz, https://bscscan.com

Integration Name: EtherFi Cash Payment Network Integration
Integrated With: Visa / Mastercard network (via payment processor), Stablecoin custodian
Purpose: Kartu kredit fisik/virtual terhubung ke smart contract wallet — spending yield restaked ETH/stablecoin di dunia nyata
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-010, EV-023
Sources: https://cash.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi

Integration Name: Binance Exchange Listing
Integrated With: Binance Exchange
Purpose: ETHFI token spot trading pair (ETHFI/USDT, ETHFI/BTC, dll) — liquidity pasar primer, retail on-ramp
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-016
Sources: https://www.binance.com/en/trade/ETHFI_USDT, https://research.binance.com/en/projects/etherfi

Integration Name: Coinbase Exchange Listing
Integrated With: Coinbase Exchange
Purpose: ETHFI token spot trading — distribusi ke user base Coinbase, ekosistem Base
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-016
Sources: https://www.coinbase.com/price/etherfi, https://www.coinbase.com/ventures/portfolio

Integration Name: OKX Exchange Listing
Integrated With: OKX Exchange
Purpose: ETHFI token spot trading — liquidity tambahan, akses pasar Asia
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-016
Sources: https://www.okx.com/trade/ETHFI-USDT, https://www.okx.com/ventures

Integration Name: Bybit Exchange Listing
Integrated With: Bybit Exchange
Purpose: ETHFI token spot trading — ekspansi liquidity ke derivatives dan spot market global
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-016
Sources: https://www.bybit.com/trade/spot/ETHFI/USDT, https://announcements.bybit.com

Integration Name: Gate.io Exchange Listing
Integrated With: Gate.io Exchange
