## Wallet Ecosystem

Wallet: MetaMask
Support Type: Full support — wallet connection via Wagmi/RainbowKit, transaction signing, token display (ETHFI, eETH, weETH)
Status: Live
Sources: https://metamask.io, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/frontend, https://app.ether.fi

Wallet: Rainbow Wallet
Support Type: Full support — native integration via RainbowKit, portfolio tracking untuk LST/LRT
Status: Live
Sources: https://rainbow.me, https://www.rainbowkit.com, https://app.ether.fi

Wallet: Coinbase Wallet
Support Type: Full support — wallet connection, Base network native support, smart wallet ready
Status: Live
Sources: https://www.coinbase.com/wallet, https://app.ether.fi

Wallet: Rabby Wallet
Support Type: Full support — multi-chain support untuk weETH di 10+ chain, transaction simulation
Status: Live
Sources: https://rabby.io, https://app.ether.fi

Wallet: WalletConnect
Support Type: Protocol support — QR code connection untuk mobile wallet ke app.ether.fi dan cash.ether.fi
Status: Live
Sources: https://walletconnect.com, https://app.ether.fi, https://cash.ether.fi

Wallet: Ledger (Hardware)
Support Type: Full support — hardware signing via MetaMask/Rabby/WalletConnect, blind signing protection untuk contract interaction
Status: Live
Sources: https://www.ledger.com, https://app.ether.fi

Wallet: Trezor (Hardware)
Support Type: Full support — hardware signing via MetaMask/Rabby, Ethereum app support
Status: Live
Sources: https://trezor.io, https://app.ether.fi

Wallet: Safe (Gnosis Safe)
Support Type: Multi-sig support — DAO treasury management, institutional vault access via Safe apps
Status: Live
Sources: https://safe.global, https://docs.ether.fi/governance, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth

Wallet: Argent
Support Type: Smart wallet support — account abstraction, social recovery, zkSync native
Status: Live
Sources: https://www.argent.xyz, https://app.ether.fi

Wallet: Zerion
Support Type: Portfolio tracking + wallet — DeFi dashboard dengan EtherFi position tracking (eETH, weETH, ETHFI)
Status: Live
Sources: https://zerion.io, https://app.zerion.io

## Developer Ecosystem

SDK: EtherFi SDK
API: EtherFi SDK (TypeScript/JavaScript) — contract interaction, staking, wrapping, bridging, vault operations, governance
Developer Tools: Foundry (Forge, Cast, Anvil) untuk smart contract dev; Hardhat untuk alternative tooling; TypeScript/Next.js untuk frontend
Open Source Repository: https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts (smart contracts), https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/frontend (frontend), https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/sdk (SDK), https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/audits (audit reports)
Developer Portal: https://docs.ether.fi/developers (jika ada; docs.ether.fi mencakup developer docs)
Hackathon: tidak diketahui — tidak ditemukan hackathon resmi EtherFi yang dipublikasikan (ETHGlobal, DoraHacks, dll mungkin memiliki track tapi tidak terverifikasi)
Grant Program: tidak diketahui — tidak ditemukan grant program resmi untuk developer eksternal (EigenLayer/Symbiotic/L2 foundation grants tersedia tapi bukan EtherFi-native)
Sources: https://github.com/etherfi-protocol, https://docs.ether.fi, https://docs.ether.fi/developers, https://book.getfoundry.sh, https://hardhat.org

## Applications

Application: EtherFi Staking (app.ether.fi)
Category: Staking Interface / Web App
Relationship: Official frontend untuk staking ETH ke eETH/weETH, portfolio tracking, yield analytics, governance voting
Status: Live
Sources: https://app.ether.fi, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/frontend, https://docs.ether.fi/staking

Application: EtherFi Cash (cash.ether.fi)
Category: Real-World Spending / RWA Bridge / FinTech App
Relationship: Non-custodial smart contract wallet terhubung ke kartu kredit fisik/virtual — spending yield restaked ETH/stablecoin
Status: Live
Sources: https://cash.ether.fi, https://blog.ether.fi, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/frontend

Application: EtherFi Vaults
Category: Institutional DeFi / Vault Protocol
Relationship: Smart contract vault untuk institutional-grade restaking — multi-AVS allocation, risk management, withdrawal queue
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/vaults, https://blog.ether.fi, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts

Application: Ultra Light Node (ULN) Marketplace
Category: Infrastructure Marketplace / Operator Network
Relationship: Permissionless operator registry — operator mendaftar, staker mendelegasikan eETH, operator menjalankan validator + AVS duties
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node, https://blog.ether.fi, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts

Application: EtherFi Governance (Snapshot + On-chain)
Category: Governance Platform
Relationship: Off-chain signaling (Snapshot) + on-chain execution (Governor + Timelock) untuk ETHFI token holder
Status: Live
Sources: https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth, https://docs.ether.fi/governance, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts

Application: Pendle eETH/weETH Markets
Category: Yield Trading / DeFi Application
Relationship: Third-party application — PT/YT markets untuk eETH/weETH yield trading di Pendle Finance
Status: Live
Sources: https://app.pendle.finance, https://docs.pendle.finance, https://blog.ether.fi

Application: EigenLayer Restaking Dashboard
Category: Restaking Dashboard
Relationship: Third-party dashboard — monitoring delegasi eETH/weETH ke EigenLayer AVS, rewards, slashing status
Status: Live
