## BUAT RINGKASAN

Primary Ecosystem: Liquid Restaking (EigenLayer + Symbiotic) dengan Liquid Staking Token (eETH/weETH) dan Governance Token (ETHFI)
Supported Chains: 11 chains (Ethereum L1 + 10 L2/L1: Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast, Linea, Scroll, zkSync Era, Mantle, BNB Chain)
External Dependencies: 22 dependencies teridentifikasi (4 Critical: EigenLayer, Ethereum, OpenZeppelin, Chainlink; 8 High: Symbiotic, Pendle, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, GitHub, Vercel, Foundry; 10 Medium/Low)
Major Integrations: 14 integrasi utama (EigenLayer core + AVS spesifik, Symbiotic, Pendle, 2 batch multi-chain 10+ chain, 6 CEX listing, EtherFi Cash payment network)
Infrastructure Providers: 11 provider (GitHub, Vercel, Dune, Etherscan, Arbiscan, Optimistic Etherscan, Basescan, Chainlink, RPC providers inferensi, monitoring inferensi)
Developer Programs: SDK (TypeScript), 4 open source repo, developer docs di docs.ether.fi, no hackathon/grant program terverifikasi
Applications: 10 aplikasi (5 first-party: Staking, Cash, Vaults, ULN, Governance; 5 third-party: Pendle, EigenLayer Dashboard, Symbiotic Interface, DefiLlama, Dune)

